 "sprite_review": {
  "score": 4.0,
  "problems": [
   "The key story feature is missing. There is no white beam going in and no rainbow fan spreading across the ground, so it reads as a crystal obelisk or monument, not a prism that splits light.",
   "There are green plants and leaves inside the glass, so it reads as a terrarium rather than clear faceted glass.",
   "The plinth is a messy pile of rough boulders with weeds and a tiny arched wooden door. That is fantasy-cottage clutter, not a clean, gold-trimmed stone plinth in a charcoal city.",
   "The silhouette is a tall thin obelisk with a pointed top. A triangular prism shape would make 'prism' clear at a glance.",
   "Scale against the person is fine (about 1.6\u00d7 his height), and the sprite sits grounded with clean edges."
  ]
 }
}